0,Mayabic languages - Wikipedia,https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mayabic_languages,"Mayabic, or Mayi, is a small family of extinct Australian Aboriginal languages of Queensland. They were once classified as Paman, but now as a separate branch of Pama–Nyungan.",Mayi-Kulan,Australian
