3,Mayi-Kulan language Facts for Kids,https://kids.kiddle.co/Mayi-Kulan_language,"G25 Mayi-Kulan, G16, G20. Mayi-Kulan is an extinct Mayi language formerly spoken on the Cape York Peninsula of Queensland, Australia. Mayi-Kulan and its dialects may be dialects of Ngawun/Wunumara.",Mayi-Kulan,Australian
